OL,4,CParents jailed for torture and death   
OL,5,Cof four-year-old girl in France in 1987
OL,6,GThe mother of a four-year-old girl     
OL,7,Gkilled in central France and found     
OL,8,Galong a motorway almost 40 years ago   
OL,9,Ghas been sentenced to 20 years in      
OL,10,Gprison.                                
OL,12,FHalima El Bakhti, 72, was found guilty 
OL,13,Fon Tuesday of "torture and acts of     
OL,14,Fbarbarity resulting in death without   
OL,15,Fthe intent to kill", French media      
OL,16,Freports.                               
OL,18,FThe girl's father, 74-year-old Ahmed   
OL,19,FTouloub, was handed a 15-year sentence 
OL,20,Fas an accomplice.                      
